# Static-analysis policy for the core test translation units.
#
# Inherits the repository policy and removes one check whose answer is not worth
# reading here. readability-function-cognitive-complexity measures branching and
# nesting, and a test function is supposed to be a long straight line of
# arrange, act, and assert; scoring one says nothing about whether the code
# under test is hard to follow, which is the only question the check was added
# to answer. Sixty-seven of its seventy-four occurrences across the tree were
# test functions, and they were the reason the seven that name real project code
# were hard to see at all.
#
# The exclusion is scoped to this directory. The check stays enabled for
# application and core sources, where its advice is sound. The Qt test
# directory carries its own file, which additionally excludes a check that is
# actively unsafe there.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -readability-function-cognitive-complexity
